sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Patient / Caller
    participant Interface as Voice / Chat Client
    participant Agent as AI Agent Orchestrator
    participant Tool as Tool Dispatcher
    participant StaffUI as Clinic Staff Dashboard
    actor Staff as Human Receptionist

    Caller->>Interface: "I have sudden severe chest pain and need a human right now!"
    Interface->>Agent: Streamed Utterance

    Note over Agent: SAFETY RULE TRIGGERED:<br/>Matches predefined acute symptom keywords.<br/>System does NOT diagnose.<br/>Immediately initiates escalation.

    Agent->>Tool: transfer_to_human(urgency="emergency", reason="Reported chest pain", conversation_summary="Caller stated acute chest pain.")
    Tool->>StaffUI: Emit WebSocket Event: ESCALATION_QUEUE_NEW_ITEM {queue_id: "ESC-901", urgency: "emergency"}
    StaffUI-->>Tool: Ack {queue_id: "ESC-901", wait_sec: 15}
    Tool-->>Agent: Handoff Initiated

    Agent->>Interface: Deliver Non-Clinical Safety Advisory:<br/>"I am transferring you to human clinic staff immediately.<br/>If this is an acute life emergency, please dial 123 (Ambulance) right away."
    Interface-->>Caller: Speaks Advisory Message

    Note over StaffUI,Staff: Staff dashboard rings with red badge
    Staff->>StaffUI: Click "Accept Call / Chat" (Queue ID: ESC-901)
    StaffUI->>Interface: Route Audio / Chat Stream to Staff Workstation
    Staff-->>Caller: "Hello, this is Nurse Laila at the front desk. How can I help you right now?"
